1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,442
Welcome to our reading practice! Today, we'll read about Matt's unique daily commute and then learn about an international family.

2
00:00:09,442 --> 00:00:13,888
Matt works in London, but flats there are very expensive.

3
00:00:13,888 --> 00:00:19,763
In Barcelona, Spain, flats are not expensive, and they are nice and big.

4
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:23,617
So, Matt works in London but lives in Barcelona!

5
00:00:23,617 --> 00:00:27,344
He flies from Barcelona to London on Monday.

6
00:00:27,344 --> 00:00:31,536
He works in London for three days and stays with his sister.

7
00:00:31,536 --> 00:00:36,307
Then he flies back to Barcelona and works from home two days a week.

8
00:00:36,307 --> 00:00:41,659
Matt doesn't speak Spanish very well, so he studies at a language school.

9
00:00:41,659 --> 00:00:45,119
He goes to Spanish classes on Saturday.

10
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:49,995
He loves Barcelona; it's a beautiful city and a great place to live.

11
00:00:49,995 --> 00:01:02,541
Which sentence about Matt is true?

12
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:07,417
The correct answer is: He lives in Barcelona and works in London.

13
00:01:07,417 --> 00:01:20,264
What does Matt say about flats in London?

14
00:01:20,264 --> 00:01:23,051
He says they are very expensive.

15
00:01:23,051 --> 00:01:35,944
What does Matt say about flats in Barcelona?

16
00:01:35,944 --> 00:01:40,008
He says they aren't very expensive and they're nice and big.

17
00:01:40,008 --> 00:01:43,944
Pablo and Alicia Moreno are married and live in New York.

18
00:01:43,944 --> 00:01:49,493
Pablo is from Spain, and Alicia is from Buenos Aires, Argentina.

19
00:01:49,493 --> 00:01:52,257
Their family is very international!

20
00:01:52,257 --> 00:01:58,712
Alicia's sister, Daniela, is 46 and lives in Buenos Aires with their mother.

21
00:01:58,712 --> 00:02:05,367
Her brother, Carlos, is 37. He lives and works in São Paulo, Brazil.

22
00:02:05,367 --> 00:02:12,275
Alicia and Pablo have two children: Alex, 19, and María, 24.

23
00:02:12,275 --> 00:02:18,451
Their son Alex is 19 and studies at university in Mexico, where he also lives.

24
00:02:18,451 --> 00:02:24,770
Their daughter María is 24. She lives in Istanbul with her Turkish husband, Mehmet.

25
00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:38,685
True or False: Pablo and Alicia have two small children.

26
00:02:38,685 --> 00:02:43,982
False. Their children are 19 and 24, so not small.

27
00:02:43,982 --> 00:02:57,758
True or False: María is married and lives in Turkey.

28
00:02:57,758 --> 00:03:03,427
True. María is married to Mehmet and lives in Istanbul, Turkey.

29
00:03:03,427 --> 00:03:17,748
True or False: Only Pablo and Alicia live in Mexico.

30
00:03:17,748 --> 00:03:24,336
False. Their son Alex lives in Mexico. Pablo and Alicia live in New York.

31
00:03:24,336 --> 00:03:36,754
Which country does Daniela live in?

32
00:03:36,754 --> 00:03:39,657
Daniela lives in Argentina.

33
00:03:39,657 --> 00:03:51,842
Which country does Carlos live in?

34
00:03:51,842 --> 00:03:54,292
Carlos lives in Brazil.

35
00:03:54,292 --> 00:04:06,582
Which country does María live in?

36
00:04:06,582 --> 00:04:09,032
María lives in Turkey.

37
00:04:09,032 --> 00:04:16,386
Great job! You've completed the reading comprehension exercises. Keep practicing your English!
